WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:09.770
Give a driver a monthly subscription so the gates open for their plate or card, and bill it every month.

2
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:14.760
Subscriptions are for tenant staff, mall staff, VIPs and regular drivers.

3
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.480
Choose New subscription.

4
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.140
Choose the plan. The price comes with it.

5
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:27.810
Who it is for: here, a tenant's staff member.

6
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:32.940
And which tenant. Their invoice can go to the brand.

7
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.890
The driver's name.

8
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:43.420
The plates. The camera at the gate reads them and opens by itself.

9
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:49.680
Or give them a card: hold it on a phone to read its number.

10
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:55.110
Auto-renew keeps it going every month. An unpaid invoice suspends it.

11
00:00:55.110 --> 00:01:02.250
Create. The first invoice is issued, and the gates know the plate at once.
